title: cursor:root
tags: [[GUI command]] [[Generic panel commands]]
kind: reference
summary: Take a panel to its top level (self / a panel type)

Takes a panel to its top level: the focused panel with `self`, the panel type named otherwise ([[Generic panel commands]]). In the [[file-manager panel]], the active repository's root — or the filesystem root `/` when the workspace has no repository, the toolbar button then reading ''root'' and not ''repo root''; in the [[path-ref panel]], the roots of the tree it walks.
